  "description": "Persistent (immutable, structurally shared) collections for .NET: vectors, RRB flex vectors, hash maps and sets, insertion-ordered maps, a persistent DAG with alternate keys and deferred reclamation of removed payloads, and incremental topological orders (Pearce–Kelly, leveled). Frozen collections are built once and read; Semifreddo collections are partially frozen: never changed in place, yet every change is a cheap new version that shares structure with the old. Transients for batch edits, ref-struct enumeration, AOT-compatible.",
